Add the version of ``junifer`` to the MD5 of the features, as for the dependencies of the markers and steps, for reproducibility: features computed with different versions of ``junifer`` are different features, so the differences between features (e.g., between datasets) can only come from the data. Running again with a new version stores the features again, with the same name, next to the ones computed with the previous version by `Fede Raimondo`_
